@CalcService1_HostAddress = http://localhost:5023

### 1. XML, nested operations: 4 x 5 = 20
POST {{CalcService1_HostAddress}}/api/calculate
Content-Type: application/xml
Accept: application/xml

<Maths>
  <Operation ID="Multiplication">
    <Value>4</Value>
    <Value>5</Value>
  </Operation>
</Maths>

### 2. XML, recursion: 2 + 3 + (4 x 5) = 25
POST {{CalcService1_HostAddress}}/api/calculate
Content-Type: application/xml
Accept: application/xml

<Maths>
  <Operation ID="Plus">
    <Value>2</Value>
    <Value>3</Value>
    <Operation ID="Multiplication">
      <Value>4</Value>
      <Value>5</Value>
    </Operation>
  </Operation>
</Maths>

### 3. JSON, nested operations (same model, same endpoint)
POST {{CalcService1_HostAddress}}/api/calculate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "operation": {
    "id": "Plus",
    "values": [ 2, 3 ],
    "operations": [
      { "id": "Multiplication", "values": [ 4, 5 ] }
    ]
  }
}

### 4. JSON, flat legacy shape with an operation alias
POST {{CalcService1_HostAddress}}/api/calculate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "operand1": 10,
  "operand2": 4,
  "operation": "divide"
}

### 5. XML, flat legacy shape (the original request contract)
POST {{CalcService1_HostAddress}}/api/calculate
Content-Type: application/xml
Accept: application/xml

<CalculateRequest>
  <Operand1>10</Operand1>
  <Operand2>5</Operand2>
  <Operation>Subtract</Operation>
</CalculateRequest>

### 6. JSON response for an XML request (content negotiation)
POST {{CalcService1_HostAddress}}/api/calculate
Content-Type: application/xml
Accept: application/json

<Maths>
  <Operation ID="Plus">
    <Value>1</Value>
    <Value>2</Value>
  </Operation>
</Maths>

### 7. Error: division by zero -> 400
POST {{CalcService1_HostAddress}}/api/calculate
Content-Type: application/xml
Accept: application/xml

<Maths>
  <Operation ID="Division">
    <Value>1</Value>
    <Value>0</Value>
  </Operation>
</Maths>

### 8. Error: unknown operation -> 400
POST {{CalcService1_HostAddress}}/api/calculate
Content-Type: application/xml
Accept: application/xml

<Maths>
  <Operation ID="Power">
    <Value>2</Value>
    <Value>8</Value>
  </Operation>
</Maths>

### 9. Error: unsupported content type -> 415
POST {{CalcService1_HostAddress}}/api/calculate
Content-Type: text/plain
Accept: application/xml

1 + 1

### 10. Health check
GET {{CalcService1_HostAddress}}/health
